{"ref":"BDB, נֶ֫טַע","hw":"נֶ֫טַע","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">נֶ֫טַע</span>]</big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>plantation, planting, plant</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">נָ֑טַע</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 14:9\" href=\"/Job.14.9\">Jb 14:9</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">נְטַע</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 5:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.5.7\">Is 5:7</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">נִטְעֵךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 17:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.17.11\">Is 17:11</a>; pl. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">נִטְעֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 17:10\" href=\"/Isaiah.17.10\">Is 17:10</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>plantation</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 5:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.5.7\">Is 5:7</a> (fig. of Judah, planted by <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>); <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 17:10\" href=\"/Isaiah.17.10\">17:10</a> (fig. of idolatry), so<br><strong>2.</strong>  act of <em>planting</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 17:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.17.11\">Is 17:11</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  <em>plant</em> <a data-ref=\"Job 14:9\" href=\"/Job.14.9\">Jb 14:9</a> (in sim.).","next":"BDB, נְטָעִים","prev":"BDB, נָטַע"}